      "sourceHash": "fnv1a64:460dd0ee88cbbd10",
      "notice": null,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "index": 0,
          "type": "warmup",
          "title": "Warm-up",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 2,
              "perItem": false,
              "source": "[PAUSE 2s]"
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Name the four words of this chapter so far."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: जाना",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जाना (jānā) — \"to go\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Sanskrit या (yā-), \"to go\", is the root; Hindi turned the initial y- into j-, which it does to many inherited words, and added the -ना ending that every Hindi doing word carries when you name it plain."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You already own three that end the same way: बोलना, देखना, सुनना. The ending is the pattern, not a coincidence, and जाना (jānā) now joins them."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "जाना (jānā) is the one doing word a traveller cannot do without. मैं स्टेशन (sṭeshan) जाता हूँ uses the same shape as मैं हिंदी बोलता हूँ, which you have been saying since the early chapters — the same frame, a different word inside it."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Five: गाड़ी (gāṛī), रेल (rel), स्टेशन (sṭeshan), टिकट (ṭikaṭ), जाना (jānā). A way to travel and a way to say you are going."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "guided-production",
          "title": "Guided Practice",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "pause",
              "seconds": 1,
